Metropolitan Museum of Art, New York · H. O. Havemeyer Collection, Bequest of Mrs. H. O. Havemeyer, 1929","permissions":{"export":true,"display":true,"download":true,"commercial":true}},"metadata":{"title":"Dancers, Pink and Green","artist":"Edgar Degas","medium":"Oil on canvas","language":"ko","description":"Edgar Degas · Dancers, Pink and Green · ca. 1890 · 캔버스에 유채 · The Metropolitan Museum of Art, New York\n\n초록빛 치마를 입은 무용수들이 각기 몸과 의상을 고쳐 잡고 있다. 인물들 뒤로 분홍빛과 초록빛 배경이 겹친다.\n\n기관 보고 액자 제외 크기: 82.19999999999999 × 75.6 cm (높이 × 너비). 전체 사진의 비율을 보존해 보고 높이에 맞춰 배치했으며, 사진 경계와 실제 채색 면의 대응은 독립적으로 측정하지 않았습니다."},"revision":1,"createdAt":"2026-10-27T18:15:55.596Z","transform":{"scale":[1,1,1],"position":[0,0,0],"rotation":[0,0,0,1]},"dimensions":{"width":0.7462894736842104,"height":0.822},"extensions":{"org.exhibitos.viewer/lod":{"version":1,"variants":[{"detail":"full","assetId":"bfa4a49d-0868-42bd-aa69-42fafac5d7f0","textureSize":1900},{"detail":"coarse","assetId":"24a029ea-8f9f-4585-a8c5-8ed8cd4a9ede","textureSize":512}]},"org.exhibitos.viewer/display-policy":{"profile":"approved-open-access-demo-v1","version":1,"approvalId":"1d1d2e20-28c4-4273-92ea-9f3c2b066d5c","sourceAssetSha256":"5ffc02ddfb46b60f8d6bb03f274fba8225607f9b2933e6dad43241f642a68398","rightsEvidenceSha256":"ade7b35095dcfb4d43d33a1409e7ba0ffef27e7e80772bb41c96553e9575208f"}},"provenance":{"events":[{"at":"2026-10-27T18:16:18.723Z","id":"a34fd2bf-fc43-463c-a146-1ad066f8c455","type":"exhibited","description":"Approved exact selected open-access display. Object https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/436140; raw SHA256 5ac2f48ac08bb167a253fb7e7fcd1376572ac6e32a5cd0855003d0353640b973; canonical SHA256 5ffc02ddfb46b60f8d6bb03f274fba8225607f9b2933e6dad43241f642a68398; recipe SHA256 46a7f932df8eab3ab581d20c1e17a488153d399764745045248382238fbf9f75; rights evidence SHA256 ade7b35095dcfb4d43d33a1409e7ba0ffef27e7e80772bb41c96553e9575208f."}],"authorship":"human-authored"},"revisionId":"35dadbcd-e6f5-47aa-a3a3-031f1